        "slc_ceddd896462adcd6cd63ca6267a1cb36d48ab8266c8c4417f2d3f4b40331abac"
      ],
      "text": "Setup requires downloading EvoCodeBench-2403 and building its execution environment per that project's instructions, which the README notes can take a few hours."
    },
